      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/sutherlin-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Long before settlers, the Umpqua Native American tribe thrived in the area that is now Sutherlin, harvesting rivers and forests.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/sutherlin-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sutherlin’s economy has deep roots in timber and agriculture, with many residents working in logging, sawmills, and farming.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/sutherlin-oregon/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Stop by the Chamber of Commerce as you enter town for a brief history lesson and local info.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
